WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.000 --> 00:01.080
I only want to know one thing:

3
00:01.630 --> 00:02.520
is he safe?

4
00:02.520 --> 00:03.840
I don't know where he is either.

5
00:04.240 --> 00:05.520
You don't know where he is?

6
00:05.520 --> 00:06.520
Where am I?

7
00:06.520 --> 00:07.400
My place.

8
00:07.400 --> 00:08.750
Now you can finally stay by my side.

9
00:08.750 --> 00:09.840
Stay by your side?

10
00:09.840 --> 00:10.630
Sir.

11
00:10.680 --> 00:10.910
Yes?

12
00:10.910 --> 00:12.910
Two pineapple buns with butter.

13
00:12.910 --> 00:17.040
One satay beef noodles from the Afternoon Tea section.

14
00:17.040 --> 00:20.590
And one BBQ pork spaghetti in soup.

15
00:20.790 --> 00:21.950
I need to use the restroom.

16
00:22.040 --> 00:23.680
You keep watching. I'll be right back.

17
00:26.310 --> 00:27.940
Foon Gor, where are you going?

18
00:28.680 --> 00:30.590
So you never intended to be with me, did you?

19
00:30.840 --> 00:32.630
It's not too late to turn back now.

20
00:33.270 --> 00:34.680
The police will find you soon.

21
00:34.680 --> 00:35.680
You won't get away.

22
00:35.910 --> 00:36.630
Hey, what are you doing?

23
00:36.630 --> 00:38.630
Shawn, it's still not too late to turn back!

24
00:39.000 --> 00:41.110
What's so special about this bin?

25
00:42.360 --> 00:42.950
Sir,

26
00:42.950 --> 00:44.310
have you seen this man?

27
00:44.310 --> 00:45.360
He's a regular.

28
00:45.520 --> 00:46.310
All these years,

29
00:46.360 --> 00:48.430
he's always ordered milk tea, fish balls, and buttered pineapple buns.

30
00:48.470 --> 00:52.310
That day, he switched to satay beef noodles and BBQ pork spaghetti in soup.

31
00:52.310 --> 00:54.380
[You're Nothing]

32
01:28.600 --> 01:31.340
♪With you, it's like I can breathe again♪

33
01:31.770 --> 01:34.540
♪I can't live without this breath, this heartbeat♪

34
01:34.660 --> 01:37.450
♪Forever's too far, but you're right here♪

35
01:37.720 --> 01:39.880
♪Together we'll take on this jaded world♪

36
01:40.020 --> 01:42.860
♪With you, I'll cross the dark, outrun the pain, and run away♪

37
01:42.940 --> 01:47.020
♪Still believing in true love, no matter how naive, calling you♪

38
01:48.600 --> 01:51.810
♪I'm willing to wait♪

39
01:52.660 --> 01:55.500
♪I love you like you're a part of me♪

40
01:55.560 --> 01:58.300
♪I want to share my life with you♪

41
01:58.940 --> 02:04.720
♪To love this deeply, I'll give a little more♪

42
02:05.070 --> 02:06.870
♪In this cold and gray city♪

43
02:06.950 --> 02:08.580
♪Through all the pain, I'll hold you. Is it true?♪

44
02:08.680 --> 02:11.030
♪Pieces of our memories slowly fade♪

45
02:11.110 --> 02:11.690
♪Stay with me♪

46
02:11.830 --> 02:14.440
♪Do you remember the day we crossed paths?♪

47
02:14.520 --> 02:15.220
♪Stay with me♪

48
02:15.300 --> 02:18.140
♪Do you remember the forever we promised?♪

49
02:18.630 --> 02:20.640
♪Who's waiting for you to save them?♪

50
02:21.170 --> 02:23.680
♪My heart aches, breaks, and struggles on♪

51
02:24.210 --> 02:26.720
♪How can I hold on to everything in one moment?♪

52
02:27.440 --> 02:30.940
♪Stop blaming fate and learn to let it be♪

53
02:32.820 --> 02:34.820
[Ash] [Episode 9]

54
03:16.520 --> 03:17.310
Boss.

55
03:17.400 --> 03:18.200
Shh.

56
03:26.270 --> 03:28.110
All communication devices and sharp objects in the house

57
03:28.310 --> 03:29.720
have been removed as you instructed.

58
03:29.840 --> 03:31.310
We've also increased patrols around the property.

59
03:32.040 --> 03:32.680
Good.

60
03:33.270 --> 03:35.200
Let me know the moment there's any news.

61
03:35.790 --> 03:36.590
No problem.

62
03:56.430 --> 03:58.360
Siu Yan hasn't been back to Feros these past few days.

63
03:58.750 --> 04:00.470
We've followed the people around him,

64
04:00.750 --> 04:02.040
but none of them has done anything unusual.

65
04:02.840 --> 04:05.470
It looks like he's deliberately hiding Mr. Mok.

66
04:09.110 --> 04:10.750
What about the cinema CCTV footage?

67
04:13.360 --> 04:15.470
We're reconstructing the route they took that day.

68
04:16.040 --> 04:17.680
We're only about 30% done.

69
04:18.720 --> 04:20.080
There's a huge amount of footage,

70
04:20.080 --> 04:21.470
so it'll take time to sort through.

71
04:22.150 --> 04:23.880
Every extra day Fei Foon spends with him

72
04:24.110 --> 04:25.470
puts him in greater danger.

73
04:26.470 --> 04:28.110
If he refuses to show himself,

74
04:28.270 --> 04:29.560
we'll have to force him out.

75
04:29.880 --> 04:33.040
But we have no idea how powerful Dreamweaver is.

76
04:33.470 --> 04:35.270
If they're backing Feros,

77
04:36.040 --> 04:38.910
a direct clash could leave both sides badly hurt.

78
04:40.040 --> 04:41.560
As long as I win,

79
04:42.040 --> 04:43.470
I don't care what it costs.

80
04:44.720 --> 04:47.270
You may not care, but other people do.

81
04:48.470 --> 04:49.150
Luk King,

82
04:49.270 --> 04:50.270
what are you doing here?

83
04:50.750 --> 04:51.750
I'm here to help.

84
04:52.470 --> 04:54.790
How many times have I told you? Stay out of Sheng Tung's affairs.

85
04:54.790 --> 04:55.840
Do you understand?

86
04:56.110 --> 04:56.880
I do.

87
04:57.240 --> 04:58.720
That's why I have no interest in Sheng Tung

88
04:58.720 --> 05:00.240
and don't know much about how it operates.

89
05:00.560 --> 05:02.880
But when it comes to legitimate business competition,

90
05:03.200 --> 05:04.750
I'm no worse than you, Loek To.

91
05:07.840 --> 05:09.680
I've been studying Feros for a long time.

92
05:09.750 --> 05:11.680
Their main business is real estate,

93
05:11.680 --> 05:13.680
yet they keep investing in port projects.

94
05:13.680 --> 05:14.840
At first, I couldn't understand why.

95
05:15.040 --> 05:16.750
But then I found out

96
05:17.630 --> 05:18.880
they've been buying these materials.

97
05:22.310 --> 05:23.520
Specialised cotton paper,

98
05:24.520 --> 05:25.560
paper mulberry bark,

99
05:26.470 --> 05:27.560
and magnetic ink?

100
05:29.150 --> 05:31.840
They're all raw materials used to make counterfeit money.

101
05:32.240 --> 05:33.750
If we want to force Feros into the open,

102
05:34.430 --> 05:36.270
we need to cut off their raw material supply.

103
05:36.430 --> 05:37.680
Once we've cut off their lifeline,

104
05:37.950 --> 05:39.360
Siu Yan will be forced to show himself.

105
05:40.560 --> 05:42.750
Ley Tung from Australia and Hon Ko from Germany

106
05:42.880 --> 05:45.430
are the two suppliers Feros deals with most often.

107
05:45.950 --> 05:49.040
Their parent companies are both listed on the Hong Kong Stock Exchange.

108
05:49.150 --> 05:50.470
Their shareholdings are widely dispersed,

109
05:50.750 --> 05:52.040
which makes them suitable takeover targets.

110
05:52.040 --> 05:52.630
Good.

111
05:53.270 --> 05:55.270
I'll put Tin Ping's capital pool in your hands.

112
05:55.430 --> 05:56.720
Whatever the price,

113
05:56.720 --> 05:58.240
make sure we secure controlling stakes in both companies.

114
05:59.430 --> 06:01.680
Actually, I've already taken care of those two.

115
06:02.040 --> 06:05.430
There's only one parent company supplying specialised cotton paper

116
06:05.750 --> 06:07.400
that Feros still has firmly under its control.

117
06:07.720 --> 06:09.680
What percentage do they own?

118
06:10.630 --> 06:11.680
Forty-nine per cent.

119
06:11.680 --> 06:12.870
We don't have enough cash flow

120
06:13.080 --> 06:14.160
to acquire it.

121
06:32.680 --> 06:33.480
Luk King,

122
06:34.270 --> 06:35.720
I'll allocate more funds to you.

123
06:37.480 --> 06:38.830
There's another way

124
06:39.480 --> 06:40.830
to force Siu Yan to show himself.

125
06:41.550 --> 06:42.480
What way?

126
06:44.230 --> 06:45.230
Buy Feros.

127
06:46.630 --> 06:47.680
You want to go that far?

128
06:50.720 --> 06:51.830
Where are you going to get the money?

129
06:52.270 --> 06:54.080
Make them an offer they can't ignore.

130
06:59.160 --> 07:01.440
That would leave you with no way back.

131
07:03.870 --> 07:05.630
I never planned on leaving myself one.

132
07:09.480 --> 07:10.270
Luk King,

133
07:10.910 --> 07:12.400
you need to move fast.

134
07:12.400 --> 07:14.510
Don't give Feros any chance to respond or fight back.

135
07:14.510 --> 07:15.310
Understood?

136
07:42.550 --> 07:43.270
Foon Gor,

137
07:43.550 --> 07:44.480
you're awake.

138
07:45.230 --> 07:46.160
How do you feel?

139
07:46.680 --> 07:47.480
I'm okay.

140
07:47.830 --> 07:48.680
That's good.

141
07:49.910 --> 07:51.120
Are you hungry?

142
07:52.270 --> 07:53.720
Let's go downstairs for breakfast.

143
07:53.760 --> 07:55.270
I've prepared plenty of food.

144
07:56.550 --> 07:57.360
Sure.

145
08:12.950 --> 08:13.630
Foon Gor,

146
08:13.910 --> 08:15.720
do you want fried eggs or scrambled eggs?

147
08:16.310 --> 08:17.270
Either is fine.

148
08:18.040 --> 08:18.590
Okay.

149
08:18.760 --> 08:19.680
Have a seat first.

150
08:20.190 --> 08:21.080
It'll be ready soon.

151
08:35.190 --> 08:35.830
Mr. Hui,

152
08:35.830 --> 08:37.040
there are a lot of reporters outside

153
08:37.040 --> 08:38.830
asking about Feros Group.

154
08:39.040 --> 08:40.630
Are they from the three major TV stations?

155
08:40.630 --> 08:41.190
Yes.

156
08:41.310 --> 08:41.830
Good.

157
08:42.480 --> 08:43.870
I want everyone to know

158
08:44.550 --> 08:46.040
that nothing can stand in my way.

159
08:52.760 --> 08:55.760
Chairman Hui!

160
08:56.870 --> 08:57.680
Mr. Hui,

161
08:57.830 --> 08:59.480
there's a rumour that Tin Ping Group

162
08:59.480 --> 09:00.720
is about to acquire Feros Group.

163
09:00.720 --> 09:02.120
Is that true?

164
09:04.870 --> 09:05.680
It's ready.

165
09:09.630 --> 09:10.910
I baked this pineapple bun myself.

166
09:10.910 --> 09:12.950
It took me quite a few tries to recreate the old taste.

167
09:14.830 --> 09:15.910
Try it and see if it's the same.

168
09:16.830 --> 09:17.830
Thanks.

169
09:17.830 --> 09:18.910
I can manage myself.

170
09:25.000 --> 09:26.040
Here.

171
09:26.230 --> 09:28.440
I said I can do it myself. You don't have to fuss over me.

172
09:32.040 --> 09:33.760
You look much better.

173
09:34.270 --> 09:35.800
Once we've eaten,

174
09:36.440 --> 09:38.230
we can think of something to do today.

175
09:38.510 --> 09:39.760
Do you want to watch a film?

176
09:40.510 --> 09:42.230
I'm trapped here with you anyway.

177
09:42.910 --> 09:44.230
Do whatever you want.

178
09:44.360 --> 09:45.230
Foon Gor,

179
09:45.270 --> 09:46.680
don't be like that.

180
09:46.870 --> 09:48.080
If there's anything you want to do,

181
09:48.680 --> 09:50.040
just tell me.

182
09:50.680 --> 09:51.480
Boss.

183
09:51.870 --> 09:52.680
What is it?

184
09:53.120 --> 09:54.910
Something's come up involving the company. Please take a look.

185
10:02.830 --> 10:04.680
There's a rumour that Tin Ping Group is about to acquire

186
10:04.680 --> 10:05.680
Feros Group.

187
10:05.680 --> 10:07.080
Is that true?

188
10:07.680 --> 10:09.680
This is purely a business decision.

189
10:10.080 --> 10:12.270
We believe Feros has enormous growth potential,

190
10:12.360 --> 10:14.440
and there is significant overlap between our businesses.

191
10:14.830 --> 10:16.080
Rather than waste resources competing with each other,

192
10:16.160 --> 10:18.720
we'd be better off combining our resources for growth.

193
10:19.310 --> 10:21.680
I look forward to meeting Siu Yan, the chairman of Feros,

194
10:21.950 --> 10:23.720
to discuss further cooperation.

195
10:23.720 --> 10:24.310
Thank you.

196
10:25.510 --> 10:26.680
Hui Loek To...

197
10:27.360 --> 10:29.310
So this is how he's forcing me out.

198
10:29.680 --> 10:31.950
Our entire raw material supply chain has been cut off.

199
10:32.270 --> 10:34.080
It's seriously delaying our deliveries.

200
10:34.440 --> 10:36.270
This isn't something we can solve in the short term.

201
10:37.270 --> 10:39.230
Get everything ready so we can return to the UK.

202
10:39.870 --> 10:41.000
Everything else

203
10:41.000 --> 10:42.680
can wait until we're back in the UK.

204
10:43.080 --> 10:44.190
We'll make new arrangements there.

205
10:44.190 --> 10:45.000
Understood, boss.

206
10:48.680 --> 10:50.160
Hui Loek To

207
10:50.160 --> 10:51.550
has caused so much trouble

208
10:53.440 --> 10:55.270
and just won't leave you alone.

209
10:57.630 --> 10:58.680
But it's okay.

210
10:59.830 --> 11:01.630
I won't let him get in our way again.

211
11:01.910 --> 11:02.720
Tomorrow,

212
11:03.480 --> 11:05.160
we're leaving for the UK.

213
11:05.830 --> 11:07.230
And we're never coming back.

214
11:07.910 --> 11:09.360
I'm not going with you.

215
11:09.830 --> 11:11.120
What is so good about him?

216
11:11.440 --> 11:12.830
Why won't you leave him?

217
11:14.080 --> 11:16.870
Because I believe that no matter what happens,

218
11:16.910 --> 11:18.440
he'll come back for me.

219
11:18.440 --> 11:19.270
So did I.

220
11:19.950 --> 11:22.120
I came all the way from the UK to find you.

221
11:22.440 --> 11:23.870
I'm the one who's willing

222
11:23.870 --> 11:26.230
to give you everything without asking for anything back.

223
11:28.630 --> 11:29.510
For you,

224
11:29.760 --> 11:31.160
I'd do anything.

225
11:31.720 --> 11:32.630
For me,

226
11:33.310 --> 11:34.630
you'd really do anything?

227
11:34.910 --> 11:35.480
Yes.

228
11:36.440 --> 11:37.830
I'd do anything for you.

229
11:38.080 --> 11:39.230
Then turn yourself in.

230
11:40.400 --> 11:42.160
Take responsibility for everything you've done.

231
11:43.270 --> 11:44.720
If you can really do that,

232
11:45.000 --> 11:47.590
I'll admit you're someone who can face the consequences.

233
11:52.360 --> 11:55.510
So you never intended to be with me at all.

234
11:56.550 --> 11:57.440
But it's okay.

235
11:57.800 --> 11:59.120
Once we leave here,

236
11:59.480 --> 12:00.950
everything will be different.

237
12:01.590 --> 12:04.550
Whether it takes one year or two,

238
12:05.310 --> 12:06.680
however many years it takes,

239
12:07.400 --> 12:09.360
I'll wait for you to change your mind.

240
12:22.270 --> 12:23.480
Any new leads?

241
12:26.400 --> 12:28.480
We reconstructed their route based on the CCTV footage.

242
12:29.510 --> 12:31.120
Mr. Mok is most likely here.

243
12:31.720 --> 12:32.680
Then what are we waiting for?

244
12:32.910 --> 12:35.120
There's only one road in and out of the mountain,

245
12:35.270 --> 12:37.000
with no shortcuts or side paths.

246
12:37.910 --> 12:41.480
There are at least dozens of guards between the perimeter and the gate,

247
12:41.720 --> 12:43.080
armed with both handguns and long guns.

248
12:43.360 --> 12:45.000
A direct assault would be extremely difficult.

249
12:45.400 --> 12:47.870
If we can confirm Mr. Mok's exact location first,

250
12:48.510 --> 12:50.590
we'll have a much better chance of getting him out safely.

251
12:54.680 --> 12:56.440
I have a way to find him.

252
12:58.230 --> 12:59.550
Out of my way!

253
12:59.680 --> 13:00.310
Move!

254
13:00.680 --> 13:01.760
Stop it, Mum.

255
13:02.160 --> 13:03.310
You brat.

256
13:03.680 --> 13:06.000
When you got engaged to Ms. So,

257
13:06.510 --> 13:08.360
I thought you'd finally grown up for the sake of the family.

258
13:08.870 --> 13:10.310
But then you kept disappearing,

259
13:11.120 --> 13:12.910
not showing up at Tin Ping or Sheng Tung.

260
13:13.120 --> 13:15.000
I turned a blind eye,

261
13:15.000 --> 13:17.120
thinking you'd come back and take charge once you'd sorted yourself out.

262
13:17.400 --> 13:20.190
But now that Eastern Hall is ripe for the taking, you're not even making a move?

263
13:20.760 --> 13:21.950
I can let all that slide.

264
13:22.720 --> 13:25.190
But now you're doing something completely pointless?

265
13:26.590 --> 13:27.510
Pointless?

266
13:27.680 --> 13:28.910
What exactly is so pointless about it?

267
13:29.120 --> 13:30.160
Don't act like you don't understand.

268
13:30.400 --> 13:33.760
Everyone knows Tin Ping's financial situation.

269
13:34.120 --> 13:36.270
The cash flow for the Bayfront Metropolis development

270
13:36.270 --> 13:37.480
is already stretched to the limit,

271
13:37.680 --> 13:40.120
and you're still spending money to acquire Feros

272
13:41.000 --> 13:44.000
and sending Sheng Tung's men out to fight everywhere,

273
13:44.800 --> 13:46.310
all for one cop?

274
13:47.270 --> 13:48.000
Hui Loek To,

275
13:48.270 --> 13:49.510
you've lost your mind!

276
13:57.480 --> 13:59.510
Don't think everything can always go your way.

277
14:00.270 --> 14:03.270
I don't want to see you destroy your father's life's work.

278
14:04.440 --> 14:07.950
The uncles have always wanted Luk King to replace you.

279
14:08.590 --> 14:10.870
Do you know how hard I've fought to keep you in charge?

280
14:11.400 --> 14:12.590
Do you?

281
14:24.760 --> 14:25.550
Mum.

282
14:29.910 --> 14:31.400
It's been a long time since I called you that.

283
14:34.550 --> 14:37.000
I know you've always loved Luk King and me,

284
14:41.310 --> 14:43.000
and that's why you've been so hard on us.

285
14:44.800 --> 14:46.120
But I'm an adult now.

286
14:48.160 --> 14:50.720
The man I love is waiting for me.

287
14:51.680 --> 14:54.080
I have to do everything I can to save him.

288
14:55.510 --> 14:58.270
If it were you or Luk King,

289
14:58.910 --> 15:01.080
I'd do everything I could to save you too,

290
15:03.360 --> 15:05.360
because you're both among the most important people in my life.

291
15:12.870 --> 15:13.870
I'm sorry.

292
15:14.510 --> 15:17.000
I just don't want you to end up

293
15:17.000 --> 15:17.950
the way your father did.

294
15:22.910 --> 15:23.720
I understand.

295
15:24.800 --> 15:25.910
Don't worry.

296
15:26.550 --> 15:28.120
I'll take care of myself.

297
15:30.590 --> 15:31.510
Luk King.

298
15:35.870 --> 15:37.000
Take good care of Mum.

299
15:39.230 --> 15:40.000
Loek To,

300
15:40.360 --> 15:41.720
whatever happens, be careful.

301
16:37.800 --> 16:38.400
Siu Yan!

302
16:38.800 --> 16:39.550
What are you doing?

303
16:39.550 --> 16:40.760
Let me out!

304
16:41.440 --> 16:42.120
Siu Yan,

305
16:42.680 --> 16:43.870
let me out!

306
16:46.080 --> 16:46.870
Siu Yan,

307
16:47.760 --> 16:49.190
listen to me.

308
16:49.910 --> 16:51.950
I'm not going to the UK with you.

309
16:52.680 --> 16:54.480
Let me out of here now!

310
16:55.310 --> 16:56.120
Siu Yan!

311
17:41.550 --> 17:48.480
[FEI FOON]

312
18:09.950 --> 18:15.510
[HERE]

313
18:24.950 --> 18:29.870
[U OK?]

314
18:32.000 --> 18:42.550
[NO UK SOON]

315
18:43.620 --> 18:46.300
♪Amor bajo un muro al borde del derrumbe♪

316
18:47.510 --> 18:55.120
[I WILL COME SAVE U]

317
18:58.680 --> 19:10.080
[NO. CALL COPS]

318
19:10.080 --> 19:12.580
♪Decido amarte a ciegas♪

319
19:13.320 --> 19:15.780
♪Supongo que merezco morir por esto♪

320
19:18.040 --> 19:21.830
[OK]

321
19:24.190 --> 19:35.000
[STAY AWAY]

322
19:35.000 --> 19:39.800
♪Solo con autoengaño creo que puedo ganar el amor♪

323
19:39.800 --> 19:43.230
[OK]

324
19:43.230 --> 19:49.000
[AFTERWARD]

325
19:49.000 --> 19:56.870
[U ME HOME]

326
19:58.100 --> 20:00.660
♪Si es un amor equivocado♪

327
20:01.830 --> 20:09.360
[I LOVE YOU]

328
20:14.590 --> 20:22.590
[ME 2]

329
20:48.160 --> 20:49.080
What is it,

330
20:49.080 --> 20:49.800
Foon Gor?

331
20:51.630 --> 20:52.760
Are you afraid of me?

332
20:54.950 --> 20:55.910
Why?

333
20:57.190 --> 20:59.230
Why do you smile and cry whenever you

334
20:59.680 --> 21:00.510
see that man?

335
21:02.000 --> 21:04.230
Why do you always look so blank when you see me?

336
21:07.190 --> 21:08.550
Do you hate me that much?

337
21:08.630 --> 21:10.080
I've never hated you.

338
21:10.590 --> 21:11.950
Shawn, snap out of it.

339
21:12.360 --> 21:14.160
You can't force someone to love you.

340
21:15.190 --> 21:16.000
Why?

341
21:16.910 --> 21:18.510
I've done so much for you.

342
21:19.550 --> 21:21.360
What does he have that I don't?

343
21:21.590 --> 21:23.040
Or do you just need a man

344
21:23.440 --> 21:24.870
who wants to sleep with you?

345
21:24.870 --> 21:25.550
Watch your mouth!

346
21:26.910 --> 21:28.590
Is that why you're rejecting me?

347
21:31.310 --> 21:32.190
Shawn,

348
21:32.480 --> 21:34.000
I've made myself perfectly clear...

349
21:35.230 --> 21:36.440
Have you lost your mind?

350
21:38.040 --> 21:39.310
You want a man, don't you?

351
21:40.120 --> 21:41.190
I can be that man too.

352
21:41.830 --> 21:43.000
Whatever he can do,

353
21:43.310 --> 21:44.550
I can do it too.

354
21:46.440 --> 21:47.230
Enough!

355
21:51.590 --> 21:52.910
Even if Hui Loek To didn't exist,

356
21:53.160 --> 21:54.800
I would never be with you.

357
21:55.160 --> 21:57.910
I've only ever seen you as a younger brother.

358
21:58.040 --> 21:59.630
I've never loved you that way. Do you understand?

359
22:00.440 --> 22:01.590
That's enough for me,

360
22:01.760 --> 22:03.360
even if you only see me as a younger brother.

361
22:04.310 --> 22:08.310
But now I don't even have a place in your heart.

362
22:08.830 --> 22:10.720
Everything you do,

363
22:11.550 --> 22:12.550
everything,

364
22:13.120 --> 22:14.760
is pushing me away.

365
22:15.080 --> 22:16.120
For more than ten years,

366
22:16.440 --> 22:18.550
you've been the reason I've kept going.

367
22:20.910 --> 22:21.720
Shawn,

368
22:22.550 --> 22:23.830
snap out of it.

369
22:28.310 --> 22:30.720
I'll never let you leave me again.

370
22:31.270 --> 22:34.000
No matter what, I won't.

371
22:36.310 --> 22:37.550
Then shoot me!

372
23:11.910 --> 23:12.680
What's the situation?

373
23:12.870 --> 23:13.910
When we arrived,

374
23:14.270 --> 23:15.720
the whole house was already empty.

375
23:15.720 --> 23:16.550
What about Fei Foon?

376
23:17.270 --> 23:18.400
I'm sorry, boss.

377
23:18.510 --> 23:20.120
We found Mr. Mok on the second floor,

378
23:20.190 --> 23:21.310
but he was already...

379
23:56.510 --> 23:57.310
Fei Foon?

380
24:11.950 --> 24:12.760
Fei Foon...

381
24:21.080 --> 24:21.870
Fei Foon,

382
24:22.360 --> 24:25.400
answer me.

383
24:35.230 --> 24:36.480
How did this happen?

384
24:42.510 --> 24:43.270
Fei Foon,

385
24:43.760 --> 24:46.800
please answer me.

386
24:51.680 --> 24:53.440
Don't go.

387
24:57.310 --> 24:58.910
I was wrong.

388
25:00.000 --> 25:02.120
I shouldn't have treated you like a bargaining chip.

389
25:06.400 --> 25:08.760
I know I was wrong. I really do.

390
25:08.760 --> 25:10.120
Please wake up, okay?

391
25:11.870 --> 25:14.310
Don't leave me all alone, okay?

392
25:17.360 --> 25:19.270
We still have to go see the glaciers together.

393
25:20.480 --> 25:23.870
Didn't you say you wanted to watch films together?

394
25:24.190 --> 25:25.360
Let's go watch a film.

395
25:27.950 --> 25:29.680
Don't leave me.

396
25:50.910 --> 25:52.590
What a touching confession of love.

397
25:53.480 --> 25:55.270
Seeing Hui Loek To so heartbroken,

398
25:55.760 --> 25:57.910
I almost cried with him.

399
25:58.270 --> 25:59.510
What a pity

400
26:00.510 --> 26:03.270
we can't witness such a tragically beautiful scene in person.

401
26:04.000 --> 26:05.480
Want to watch it again?

402
26:09.120 --> 26:12.760
Mok Fei Foon is already back by Hui Loek To's side.

403
26:13.680 --> 26:15.800
What should I call you from now on?

404
26:16.550 --> 26:18.270
Call me whatever you want.

405
26:19.230 --> 26:20.910
But no matter what you call me,

406
26:21.760 --> 26:23.120
I'll always be myself.

407
26:23.800 --> 26:25.080
That will never change.

408
26:27.190 --> 26:28.040
Is that so?

409
26:30.160 --> 26:31.910
The man who claims to love you so much

410
26:32.400 --> 26:33.950
can't even tell the real you from a fake.

411
26:40.950 --> 26:42.120
Just imagine.

412
26:42.400 --> 26:43.910
He cried and begged for forgiveness,

413
26:44.680 --> 26:46.480
held that body tightly,

414
26:46.590 --> 26:48.720
ran his hands all over him,

415
26:49.510 --> 26:51.510
and never even realised it wasn't you.

416
26:52.310 --> 26:53.910
He doesn't know you at all.

417
26:54.680 --> 26:56.550
If that man was Hui Loek To,

418
26:57.360 --> 26:59.760
he'd know it wasn't me.

419
27:00.080 --> 27:01.120
He'd know.

420
27:01.680 --> 27:03.480
Whether he knows or not,

421
27:03.950 --> 27:05.590
we're leaving this place

422
27:05.590 --> 27:07.000
and starting a new life.

423
27:07.680 --> 27:08.910
Most importantly,

424
27:09.590 --> 27:10.910
I'll show you

425
27:11.270 --> 27:14.550
that I love and respect you more than Hui Loek To does.

426
27:15.270 --> 27:17.230
I'll never let you suffer.

427
27:17.230 --> 27:18.120
We'll live openly and honestly...

428
27:18.120 --> 27:18.950
Openly and honestly?

429
27:19.720 --> 27:22.120
How can I do that when I'm leaving

430
27:24.120 --> 27:25.680
with a wanted criminal?

431
27:27.870 --> 27:31.680
Is this your idea of love and respect?

432
27:32.680 --> 27:33.800
Just say yes.

433
27:33.800 --> 27:34.910
All this will only be temporary.

434
27:34.910 --> 27:35.720
Shawn.

435
27:37.160 --> 27:38.680
Do whatever you want.

436
27:41.120 --> 27:43.000
As long as I'm by your side,

437
27:43.720 --> 27:46.800
I'll do everything I can to stop you.

438
27:47.720 --> 27:49.510
You can take me away,

439
27:50.910 --> 27:55.120
but you'll never have another peaceful night's sleep.

440
27:56.120 --> 27:57.550
Do you really hate me that much?

441
27:59.910 --> 28:00.720
Why?

442
28:01.480 --> 28:03.360
I've done so much for you.

443
28:05.400 --> 28:06.590
So much...

444
28:10.400 --> 28:11.680
Shoot me.

445
28:14.910 --> 28:16.270
You're not doing this for me.

446
28:18.080 --> 28:20.360
You're doing it for the person in your imagination.

447
28:20.510 --> 28:22.190
And that person no longer exists.

448
28:23.400 --> 28:24.870
I love you.

449
28:25.160 --> 28:26.360
I love the person you were,

450
28:27.120 --> 28:28.190
and the person you are now.

451
28:28.950 --> 28:30.400
I love every version of you.

452
28:31.720 --> 28:34.120
Why won't you ever give me a chance?

453
28:35.680 --> 28:37.190
Because the man I love

454
28:38.000 --> 28:39.000
is Hui Loek To.

455
28:43.310 --> 28:44.720
He doesn't love you!

456
28:44.720 --> 28:45.800
But I love him!

457
28:48.510 --> 28:50.870
From the moment we met,

458
28:52.270 --> 28:54.400
my feelings for him have never changed.

459
28:55.480 --> 28:56.510
Not once.

460
28:58.360 --> 29:00.190
And they won't until the day I die.

461
29:55.190 --> 29:57.860
Boss, we've found something at the marina.

462
29:58.140 --> 29:59.100
I'm on my way.

463
30:02.870 --> 30:03.590
What's the situation?

464
30:03.590 --> 30:05.830
We found a yacht belonging to Siu Yan docked here.

465
30:23.120 --> 30:24.160
- Split up and search. - Split up and search.

466
30:39.760 --> 30:40.800
Where's Fei Foon?

467
30:49.910 --> 30:51.120
Where is he?

468
30:52.590 --> 30:53.480
Feros.

469
30:54.480 --> 30:55.400
Dreamweaver.

470
30:56.360 --> 30:58.120
They're both doomed because of you.

471
31:00.000 --> 31:00.800
Congratulations.

472
31:01.760 --> 31:03.680
I'm asking you. Where is Fei Foon?

473
31:04.190 --> 31:05.590
Tell me something first.

474
31:06.000 --> 31:07.080
I'm curious.

475
31:08.000 --> 31:09.870
How did you know that wasn't Fei Foon?

476
31:10.120 --> 31:12.080
What Fei Foon and I share

477
31:12.440 --> 31:13.870
is something you'll never understand.

478
31:14.910 --> 31:16.270
I'm in no hurry.

479
31:17.270 --> 31:18.680
Take your time and tell me.

480
31:24.510 --> 31:26.400
Where is Fei Foon?

481
31:28.310 --> 31:29.120
Hui Loek To,

482
31:30.080 --> 31:31.480
Fei Foon really does love you.

483
31:32.040 --> 31:33.080
Do you know that?

484
31:33.270 --> 31:34.160
Enough.

485
31:34.950 --> 31:36.360
Where is Fei Foon?

486
31:37.480 --> 31:38.720
How about I tell you

487
31:38.870 --> 31:41.310
what Fei Foon looked like

488
31:41.800 --> 31:43.120
when I held a gun to his head?

489
31:47.720 --> 31:48.870
You killed him?

490
31:50.080 --> 31:50.870
What's wrong?

491
31:51.910 --> 31:53.590
You want to know where he is?

492
31:53.680 --> 31:54.590
Get on your knees

493
31:55.040 --> 31:56.720
and shoot yourself.

494
31:57.190 --> 31:58.720
Before you take your last breath,

495
31:59.270 --> 32:00.870
I might decide to tell you.

496
32:06.910 --> 32:10.800
I just want to know if Fei Foon is safe.

497
32:10.800 --> 32:11.800
What?

498
32:12.510 --> 32:14.800
Even if you knew, what could you do about it?

499
32:15.680 --> 32:17.400
Do you really think you can get back together with him?

500
32:18.310 --> 32:20.120
I've made far too many mistakes.

501
32:22.000 --> 32:23.950
I never knew how to respect him,

502
32:25.160 --> 32:26.910
and I put him through so much humiliation

503
32:28.080 --> 32:29.040
and pain.

504
32:31.400 --> 32:33.590
Of course I want him back by my side.

505
32:35.270 --> 32:36.590
But if he wants to leave,

506
32:37.400 --> 32:38.630
I won't force him to stay.

507
32:40.720 --> 32:41.910
I just want him

508
32:42.830 --> 32:44.080
to be safe.

509
32:45.480 --> 32:46.400
Shawn,

510
32:47.830 --> 32:49.480
you love him very much, don't you?

511
32:50.550 --> 32:52.360
I know you wouldn't hurt him.

512
32:55.360 --> 32:58.270
If you really intend to keep him by your side,

513
32:59.910 --> 33:00.950
promise me one thing.

514
33:02.720 --> 33:03.760
Treat him well.

515
33:04.480 --> 33:07.190
Don't make him suffer anymore, okay?

516
33:07.720 --> 33:09.180
Stop lying.

517
33:09.480 --> 33:10.760
You'd never let him go.

518
33:24.910 --> 33:25.800
Promise me.

519
33:26.910 --> 33:27.720
Take good care of Fei Foon.

520
33:39.120 --> 33:40.190
You're so lucky.

521
33:41.630 --> 33:42.800
Do you think you've won?

522
33:44.480 --> 33:47.480
I'll always be the one who loves Fei Foon the most.

523
33:54.310 --> 33:55.120
Shawn!

524
34:00.510 --> 34:01.310
Shawn!

525
34:07.510 --> 34:08.000
Shawn?

526
34:08.040 --> 34:08.830
It really is you.

527
34:09.950 --> 34:11.480
I knew you wouldn't forget me.

528
34:12.590 --> 34:14.000
Your birthday is coming up.

529
34:14.630 --> 34:17.360
I booked a set menu at a three-Michelin-star restaurant.

530
34:17.630 --> 34:18.950
I want to take you there.

531
34:18.950 --> 34:20.630
I've thought it through.

532
34:20.950 --> 34:23.760
Why don't we go out today?

533
34:24.120 --> 34:26.000
I'd like to get to know you better.

534
34:36.830 --> 34:38.830
You're so sweet, Foon Gor.

535
34:46.360 --> 34:47.120
Go.

536
34:51.630 --> 34:53.120
I said go!

537
35:11.230 --> 35:13.120
I'll do what I have to do,

538
35:13.910 --> 35:17.080
but I'll give you time to turn yourself in.

539
35:23.230 --> 35:24.160
Goodbye,

540
35:24.870 --> 35:25.760
Fei Foon.

541
35:29.680 --> 35:30.480
Boss!

542
35:33.080 --> 35:33.870
Are you okay?

543
35:35.680 --> 35:36.440
I'm fine.

544
35:36.550 --> 35:39.630
We searched the entire yacht, but we couldn't find anyone.

545
35:50.310 --> 35:50.910
Breaking news.

546
35:50.910 --> 35:53.000
Acting on intelligence provided by an undercover officer,

547
35:53.000 --> 35:56.040
police have cracked a major transnational counterfeit money case.

548
35:56.040 --> 35:56.830
So far,

549
35:56.830 --> 35:58.910
several suspects have been arrested

550
35:58.910 --> 36:00.680
and are now being questioned.

551
36:25.760 --> 36:26.550
Hey!

552
36:43.120 --> 36:44.360
Can you stop being a police officer?

553
36:49.910 --> 36:51.590
If I quit, are you going to support me?

554
36:58.080 --> 36:59.120
I'll support you!

555
37:09.370 --> 37:13.020
♪Who still longs for a love they know can never be?♪

556
37:15.990 --> 37:20.480
♪Who was torn apart by the boundaries of this world?♪

557
37:22.790 --> 37:26.780
♪Who, at death's door, whispers only one name?♪

558
37:28.370 --> 37:34.310
♪Who hides his feelings away again when the neon lights come on?♪

559
37:35.070 --> 37:38.620
♪Afraid to lay my feelings bare♪

560
37:38.680 --> 37:41.700
♪Afraid to love out in the open♪

561
37:42.050 --> 37:45.100
♪Fate brought us together♪

562
37:45.440 --> 37:48.220
♪But never gave us an answer♪

563
37:52.530 --> 37:56.600
♪And say, "I'm so glad it's you"♪

564
37:56.750 --> 38:00.030
♪The time is right, even the wind is on our side♪

565
38:00.180 --> 38:03.380
♪At this very moment, the sun and moon shine on us♪

566
38:03.440 --> 38:05.380
♪Never mind what others may say♪

567
38:05.490 --> 38:06.920
♪Never mind how wild the rumours run♪

568
38:06.930 --> 38:10.170
♪I just happened to meet you, and that's all that matters♪

569
38:10.180 --> 38:13.440
♪The time is right, true love is on our side♪

570
38:13.450 --> 38:16.760
♪At this very moment, the sun and moon shine on us♪

571
38:16.790 --> 38:18.680
♪No need to hide any of these feelings♪

572
38:18.700 --> 38:20.360
♪No need to pretend we're distant♪

573
38:20.380 --> 38:24.930
♪I just happened to meet you, and that's all that matters♪

574
38:30.230 --> 38:34.200
♪Who understands the emotions raging beneath my silence?♪

575
38:37.150 --> 38:41.490
♪Who shared both the bustle and the silence with me?♪

576
38:42.680 --> 38:47.620
♪Who cast aside every rule the world imposed?♪

577
38:49.320 --> 38:55.550
♪Who became the one exception in all my years?♪

578
38:55.620 --> 38:58.420
♪Through dark alleys with no lights♪

579
38:58.740 --> 39:02.020
♪We kept our unspoken understanding alive♪

580
39:02.050 --> 39:05.060
♪Time chose to favour us♪

581
39:05.340 --> 39:09.980
♪And gifted me this encounter♪

582
39:10.120 --> 39:13.060
♪The time is right, even the wind is on our side♪

583
39:13.440 --> 39:16.690
♪At this very moment, the sun and moon shine on us♪

584
39:16.840 --> 39:18.720
♪Never mind what others may say♪

585
39:18.740 --> 39:20.440
♪Never mind how wild the rumours run♪

586
39:20.440 --> 39:23.520
♪I just happened to meet you, and that's all that matters♪

587
39:23.530 --> 39:26.380
♪The time is right, even the wind is on our side♪

588
39:26.700 --> 39:30.140
♪At this very moment, the sun and moon shine on us♪

589
39:30.240 --> 39:32.080
♪No need to hide any of these feelings♪

590
39:32.110 --> 39:33.750
♪No need to pretend we're distant♪

591
39:33.790 --> 39:37.680
♪I just happened to meet you, and that's all that matters♪

592
39:37.690 --> 39:40.460
♪Thankfully, through the ebb and flow of the crowd...♪

593
39:41.650 --> 39:46.450
[Fireworks still warm, ashes still aglow. Grateful we met, grateful you stayed.]

594
39:46.820 --> 39:51.440
[Our story pauses here. In another world, a new chapter begins.]

595
39:51.700 --> 39:56.240
[May everything go well for you. May every true devotion in this world...]

596
39:56.860 --> 39:58.640
♪Never mind what others may say♪

597
39:58.740 --> 40:00.410
♪Never mind how wild the rumours run...♪

598
40:01.040 --> 40:03.550
Your favourite pineapple bun.

599
40:04.360 --> 40:06.510
How did you conjure up a pineapple bun?

600
40:06.510 --> 40:07.510
Never mind that.

601
40:08.590 --> 40:10.440
Once you've finished it,

602
40:11.360 --> 40:12.720
we've still got plenty to do.

603
40:12.720 --> 40:14.680
Our time together is precious.

604
40:20.440 --> 40:21.760
It's pretty good.

605
40:21.760 --> 40:23.000
Where did you buy it?

606
40:23.000 --> 40:24.190
From your usual place.

607
40:26.000 --> 40:28.800
Did the boss recognise you?

608
40:29.590 --> 40:30.830
He did.

609
40:31.120 --> 40:32.080
Of course he did.

610
40:32.080 --> 40:33.590
Was he like, "Why is this guy here again?"

611
40:34.270 --> 40:35.550
Of course not.

612
40:35.870 --> 40:38.630
I'm Tin Ping Group's

613
40:39.190 --> 40:41.360
number one heartthrob.

614
40:43.270 --> 40:46.270
He probably saw you get kidnapped last time.

615
40:47.040 --> 40:48.190
Who knows?

616
40:49.120 --> 40:50.800
He didn't even call anyone.

617
40:52.190 --> 40:54.360
How heartless.

618
40:54.360 --> 40:55.720
He wasn't much help at all.

619
40:56.360 --> 40:57.800
He didn't call anyone?

620
40:58.550 --> 41:00.230
Who was he supposed to call?

621
41:00.680 --> 41:02.190
The crust's falling off.

622
41:06.440 --> 41:07.400
Come here.

623
41:08.870 --> 41:09.800
What for?

624
41:11.650 --> 41:14.740
[...find its home and endure in peace.]

625
41:19.090 --> 41:40.180
[Episode 9] [This story is fictional. Any resemblance is entirely coincidental.]
